    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00367",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "用右手从腰带里取出一只带盖的怀表，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "with her right hand took a covered pocket watch from her sash,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00367",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "用左手指尖摸了摸字盘，说：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "touched the dial with the fingertips of her left hand, and said:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00367",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "“两点三十五分了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It is two thirty-five.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00367",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "三点半还得上车站去，不过晚一点也没关系。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I still have to go to the station at three-thirty, but it does not matter if I am a little late.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
